WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.233 --> 00:00:02.836
Deputy Defense Science Minister, Rather,

00:00:03.236 --> 00:00:04.971
has died after feeling

00:00:04.971 --> 00:00:06.473
ill on a plane on Saturday.

00:00:06.473 --> 00:00:06.606
That's

00:00:06.606 --> 00:00:07.941
according to the Ministry of Science

00:00:07.941 --> 00:00:08.808
in Higher Education.

00:00:08.808 --> 00:00:10.276
The Putin critic

00:00:10.276 --> 00:00:12.145
was part of a Russian delegation

00:00:12.145 --> 00:00:14.314
returning from a business trip to Cuba,

00:00:14.314 --> 00:00:14.881
and the plane

00:00:14.881 --> 00:00:15.815
made an emergency

00:00:15.815 --> 00:00:16.950
landing in southern Russia,

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:18.151
where doctors unsuccessfully

00:00:18.151 --> 00:00:19.252
tried to treat him.

00:00:19.252 --> 00:00:20.787
The cause of death isn't known,

00:00:20.787 --> 00:00:22.322
but an autopsy is scheduled

00:00:22.322 --> 00:00:23.089
for Wednesday.

00:00:23.089 --> 00:00:23.890
CNN's Salma

00:00:23.890 --> 00:00:25.058
Abdelaziz is following

00:00:25.058 --> 00:00:26.192
these developments and joins

00:00:26.192 --> 00:00:28.128
us now with the latest.

00:00:28.128 --> 00:00:29.496
Salma, tell us what you know.

00:00:29.496 --> 00:00:29.929
And also,

00:00:29.929 --> 00:00:30.997
I was surprised

00:00:30.997 --> 00:00:32.565
that there would be any latitude

00:00:32.565 --> 00:00:35.035
for a critic of the Kremlin

00:00:35.035 --> 00:00:37.137
within the government in Russia.

00:00:37.137 --> 00:00:38.438
Well, throughout this conflict,

00:00:38.438 --> 00:00:39.572
there have been moments

00:00:39.572 --> 00:00:40.940
where we've heard from

00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:42.108
I will give you the example

00:00:42.108 --> 00:00:44.577
of state owned energy companies

00:00:45.478 --> 00:00:47.347
where Lukoil that's one,

00:00:47.347 --> 00:00:49.015
the one that I'm mentioning here

00:00:49.015 --> 00:00:50.283
openly criticized

00:00:50.283 --> 00:00:51.484
the conflict in Ukraine.

00:00:51.484 --> 00:00:52.986
There have been moments, of course,

00:00:52.986 --> 00:00:54.154
especially at the beginning

00:00:54.154 --> 00:00:55.055
of this conflict,

00:00:55.055 --> 00:00:57.690
where there have been voices of dissent.

00:00:58.058 --> 00:00:59.526
But the result of that

00:00:59.526 --> 00:01:02.529
has been a string of murky deaths.

00:01:02.529 --> 00:01:06.699
And this latest death is Peter Franco.

00:01:06.933 --> 00:01:07.700
He's a senior

00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:08.668
Russian lawmaker

00:01:08.668 --> 00:01:10.437
he's the deputy minister of science

00:01:10.437 --> 00:01:11.704
and higher education.

00:01:11.704 --> 00:01:13.073
What we understand took place,

00:01:13.073 --> 00:01:15.075
and this is according to the ministry's

00:01:15.075 --> 00:01:16.242
website information

00:01:16.242 --> 00:01:16.876
page,

00:01:16.876 --> 00:01:18.244
is that he was returning

00:01:18.244 --> 00:01:20.146
from a business trip in Cuba.

00:01:20.146 --> 00:01:22.082
He fell ill on the plane.

00:01:22.082 --> 00:01:24.284
The plane landed in southern Russia

00:01:24.484 --> 00:01:26.252
right near the border with Georgia.

00:01:26.252 --> 00:01:27.520
He was treated

00:01:27.520 --> 00:01:29.489
and according to the ministry's website,

00:01:29.489 --> 00:01:30.256
he died.

00:01:30.256 --> 00:01:31.391
Now, members of his family

00:01:31.391 --> 00:01:33.026
have indicated potentially

00:01:33.026 --> 00:01:33.693
that it could have been

00:01:33.693 --> 00:01:35.829
a heart condition, a heart issue.

00:01:35.829 --> 00:01:37.897
But this is being treated as suspicious

00:01:37.897 --> 00:01:40.900
because he was known to have criticized

00:01:41.468 --> 00:01:42.569
President Putin,

00:01:42.569 --> 00:01:43.770
most recently

00:01:43.770 --> 00:01:45.472
to a very prominent

00:01:45.472 --> 00:01:47.040
journalist, Roman Super,

00:01:47.040 --> 00:01:48.374
who said he spoke to him

00:01:48.374 --> 00:01:49.242
just days

00:01:49.242 --> 00:01:51.244
before this business trip to Cuba.

00:01:51.478 --> 00:01:53.079
He says that in that phone call

00:01:53.079 --> 00:01:55.281
he expressed, this lawmaker expressed

00:01:55.582 --> 00:01:57.617
serious concerns about his safety

00:01:57.884 --> 00:01:59.986
He said that he was afraid for his life.

00:01:59.986 --> 00:02:02.122
He said that he was essentially a hostage

00:02:02.122 --> 00:02:02.922
of the Kremlin,

00:02:02.922 --> 00:02:03.823
that his passport

00:02:03.823 --> 00:02:04.757
was taken away,

00:02:04.757 --> 00:02:06.793
that he had no control of his movements.

00:02:07.127 --> 00:02:08.628
He said he was distressed

00:02:08.628 --> 00:02:09.529
and depressed,

00:02:09.529 --> 00:02:11.231
that he was taking tranquilizers

00:02:11.231 --> 00:02:13.066
and antidepressants.

00:02:13.066 --> 00:02:15.602
So painting a very worrying picture here.

00:02:15.802 --> 00:02:17.070
I want to pull up this graphic

00:02:17.070 --> 00:02:18.037
that shows you

00:02:18.037 --> 00:02:19.539
about a dozen different

00:02:19.539 --> 00:02:21.407
officials, businessmen,

00:02:21.407 --> 00:02:23.376
just since the beginning of last year.

00:02:23.376 --> 00:02:25.178
So right around the time of the start

00:02:25.178 --> 00:02:27.247
of the invasion of Ukraine,

00:02:27.447 --> 00:02:28.848
who have all died or

00:02:29.883 --> 00:02:30.683
fell, you

00:02:30.683 --> 00:02:31.985
know, met their death

00:02:31.985 --> 00:02:33.720
in apparent suicide.

00:02:33.720 --> 00:02:34.888
I want to bring you the case

00:02:34.888 --> 00:02:36.289
of one of them,

00:02:36.289 --> 00:02:39.492
Rafael Magana, He died in September

00:02:39.492 --> 00:02:41.594
after falling out of the window

00:02:41.594 --> 00:02:42.929
of a hospital.

00:02:42.929 --> 00:02:44.430
He was a chairman

00:02:44.430 --> 00:02:47.033
for one of these energy companies, Lukoil

00:02:47.233 --> 00:02:49.068
and he had expressed

00:02:49.068 --> 00:02:50.904
dissent, criticism

00:02:50.904 --> 00:02:52.972
of President Putin's war in Ukraine.

00:02:52.972 --> 00:02:53.740
Again,

00:02:53.940 --> 00:02:56.042
Russia is not claiming responsibility.

00:02:56.242 --> 00:02:58.311
It will not claim responsibility.

00:02:58.311 --> 00:02:59.846
But this just adds to that

00:02:59.846 --> 00:03:01.848
climate of fear, that sense

00:03:01.848 --> 00:03:03.883
that there are consequences

00:03:04.117 --> 00:03:05.251
if you speak out.

00:03:05.251 --> 00:03:06.753
It also wouldn't be the first time

00:03:06.753 --> 00:03:08.221
the US or U.K.

00:03:08.221 --> 00:03:09.389
intelligence services

00:03:09.389 --> 00:03:10.089
have identified

00:03:10.089 --> 00:03:10.924
a suspicious death

00:03:10.924 --> 00:03:12.358
at the hands of the Kremlin,

00:03:12.358 --> 00:03:13.860
which ostensibly could appear

00:03:13.860 --> 00:03:15.762
like a heart condition as well.

00:03:15.762 --> 00:03:16.563
Some analysts

00:03:16.563 --> 00:03:17.964
thank you so much for joining us.

